libexword
------------------------------------------
libexword is a library that implements the low-level OBEX commands used to
communicate Casio EX-word dictionaries.

Runtime requirements:
  cygwin-3.6.12-1
  libexword-devel-1.0.1-1bl3
  libexword1-1.0.1-1bl3
  libiconv2-1.19-2
  libreadline8-8.3-1
  libusb1.0-1.0.21-1
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  pkg-config-3.0.10-1

Build requirements:
(besides corresponding -devel packages)
  autoconf-20260320-3
  automake-20261107-1
  binutils-2.47-1
  cygport-0.37.12-1
  gcc-core-14.4.0-1
  libiconv-devel-1.19-2
  libreadline-devel-8.3-1
  libtool-2.6.2-1
  libusb1.0-devel-1.0.21-1
  make-4.4.1-2

Canonical website:
  https://github.com/brijohn/libexword

Canonical download:
  https://github.com/brijohn/libexword/archive/refs/tags/rel1.0.1.tar.gz

-------------------------------------------

Build instructions:
  1. unpack libexword-1.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  2. if you use setup to install this src package,
     it will be unpacked under /usr/src automatically
        % cd /usr/src
        % cygport ./libexword-1.0.1-X.cygport all

This will create:
  /usr/src/libexword-1.0.1-X-src.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libexword-1.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libexword1-1.0.1-X.tar.xz
  /usr/src/libexword-devel-1.0.1-X.tar.xz

-------------------------------------------

Files included in the binary package:

(libexword)
  /usr/bin/exword.exe
  /usr/share/doc/Cygwin/libexword.README
  /usr/share/doc/libexword/AUTHORS
  /usr/share/doc/libexword/ChangeLog
  /usr/share/doc/libexword/README
  /usr/share/doc/libexword/models.txt
  /usr/share/doc/libexword/protocol.txt

(libexword1)
  /usr/bin/cygexword-1.dll

(libexword-devel)
  /usr/include/exword.h
  /usr/lib/libexword.dll.a
  /usr/lib/pkgconfig/libexword.pc

